# Omoluabi News — MVP v1 environment configuration
#
# There are currently no environment variables required to run this
# site. It has no server, no database, and no API keys of any kind —
# including no AI-provider key of any kind (see
# docs/decisions/002-no-frontier-model-core-dependency.md).
#
# This file exists so the repository has a documented, safe place to
# record configuration if/when it needs one, per the directive's
# requirement not to leave this file absent. Nothing below is active.
#
# tools/research_scraper.py currently hardcodes its User-Agent string
# and per-request rate limit (read from sources/source_registry.json,
# not from the environment) rather than reading either from a variable —
# see docs/DEVELOPER_SETUP.md, "Known platform assumptions."
